      "en": "A free interactive Grade 1 time activity: read an analog clock at o'clock AND half-past times, then tap the matching digital time. Children must read BOTH hands — the long hand on 12 for o'clock or on 6 for half past — to tell 3:00 from 3:30. Sprocket the rooster cheers them on. A friendly next step in telling time after the hour. Common Core 1.MD.B.3.",
